  "summary": "This paper introduces a method to make CNNs translation-insensitive using Gaussian-Hermite basis functions, improving stability to small shifts while preserving efficiency. It focuses on architectural design and theoretical guarantees for image classification tasks.",
  "key_insight": "Translation insensitivity in CNNs can be achieved efficiently via Gaussian-Hermite basis approximation without sacrificing training speed or memory usage."
}

